                                            [description] => In February 2025, data obtained from an earlier Adpost breach surfaced. The dataset contained 3.3M records including email addresses, usernames, and display names. <a href="https://www.adpost.com/article/security-update-regarding-the-february-2025-adpost-data-breach" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Adpost later published a disclosure notice</a> and advised they'd forced a credential refresh, among other actions.
